    {
      "id": "flow-one",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 69.5048382695577,
      "y": 1686.2003957044944,
      "width": 1760,
      "height": 110,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 44,
      "version": 26,
      "versionNonce": 1031257628,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791461362641,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Build robot with NormalWalk + NormalTalk + NoFly  →  2. robot.fly() delegates to its NoFly object  →  3. Later replace it with NormalFly  →  4. Same robot now flies.\n\nThe robot does not need to know how walking, talking, or flying is implemented. Each behavior object knows its own job.",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 18,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Build robot with NormalWalk + NormalTalk + NoFly  →  2. robot.fly() delegates to its NoFly object  →  3. Later replace it with NormalFly  →  4. Same robot now flies.\n\nThe robot does not need to know how walking, talking, or flying is implemented. Each behavior object knows its own job.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "ah"
    },
